// DEFECT (wrong answer; matches 009.3). A fact derived from the clock is stamped at the first
// phrase that sees it, so `Held` on it depends on which days the program visits. With `@ 7.`
// before `@ 9.` the last claim fails.
Param start : Time = 0
Bool second-week Holds when Current Time - start >= 7
Bool a-day-into-it Holds when Held(second-week()) For 1
.
@ 9.
?second-week().
?!a-day-into-it().       // WRONG: day 9 is two days into the second week
